  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Derail": "DERAILING\\n1. Broken track (open rail end) at speed.\\n2. A very hard impact (about 8 m/s or more).\\nDerailed: engine dead, controls dead, and\\nshe will not move until she is put back.\\nShe can be. It is a long job and not one\\nclick - see the next page.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Fuel": "She burns fuel at idle too - shut her down.\\nDIESEL only - petrol is no use to her.\\nCan: right-click the loco ->\\n'Pour diesel into locomotive'.\\nBulk tanks: Muldraugh depot; Valley Station\\nfreight terminal: platform road, not main.\\n-> 'Refuel locomotive from the tank'\\n   (she must be standing at it);\\n-> 'Fill container from the tank'.\\nEach tank has its own finite reserve.\\nSiphoning diesel back out needs a hose.\\nThe battery drains on starts and lights.\\nFlat - a running generator nearby, then\\ncrank. There is no depot charger.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Panel": "Six dials: speed, amperes, brake air,\\nengine revs, fuel, water.\\nWater is temperature, not a supply.\\nAmperes = real pull. Throttle open and the\\nneedle at 0 means she will not move.\\nWith the diesel off the throttle quadrant is\\nthe starter: START / PRIME / CRANK / WARMING.\\nLAMPS\\nHEAD, CAB - a light is on.\\nGEN - the diesel is running.\\nBATT: amber - few starts left in her,\\nred - the starter will not turn.\\nCOND: amber - power is dropping,\\nred - she can stall on her own.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Place": "K&L 800, GP7. Muldraugh depot, covered stall.\\nFound cold and parked.\\n[E] beside her - board the cab.\\n[E] in the cab - get off (she stops first).\\nOr right-click her: climb in / leave.\\n[V] - cab menu: sleep, headlight, leave.\\nOrder: board -> reverser to N -> start [W].\\nOn a controller: interact climbs in and out.\\nHer controls are on the pad too - see below.\\nOn a server: one driver, the rest ride.\\nServer only: [V] takes or gives up the controls.\\nLog out in the cab - your seat is kept.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Repair": "REPAIR\\nRight-click her -> 'Repair locomotive\\nwith a wrench'. Five minutes of work,\\n+5%% of condition, one point off the wrench.\\nTwenty passes bring her back from zero;\\na wrench is good for nine of them.\\nNo skill, no depot, no parts needed.\\nDuct tape works too: +0.5%% a strip, four\\nstrips to a roll, and it refuses above 10%%.\\nEnough to get a dead engine turning over\\nand limp to the depot. At 10%% she pulls\\nbadly and stalls.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Rerail": "BACK ON THE RAILS\\nRight-click her -> 'Rerailing'. Five phases,\\nabout four hours of work.\\nChock the good truck, dig out the ballast,\\njack the derailed one up on packed timber,\\nwalk it over to the rails, spike two frogs\\ndown over the railhead. Last phase is the\\nPULL: from the seat, with the diesel running.\\nThe pull needs a licence, and it can fail at\\nthe top and cost an hour back.\\nKIT: two frogs, track jack, rail chock,\\nspike maul, claw bar, six spikes, chain,\\nshovel, four planks. The rail gear is kept\\nin railroad buildings. Anything in reach does.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Run": "[R] - reverser: N -> FORWARD -> REVERSE -> N.\\nMove it only at a standstill.\\nAt N the throttle is locked, amperes read 0.\\n[W] notch up, [S] notch down. 0 to 8.\\nPower only with the diesel running.\\nHold [Space] - air brake.\\nOrder: throttle to 0, then brake.\\nHold right mouse - look down the line.\\nON A CONTROLLER\\nD-pad up / down - throttle. Left - reverser.\\nRight stick click - brake. It stays set;\\nclick again to release it.\\nD-pad right, held - the cab menu.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Signals": "Hold [Q] - horn.\\n[L] - bell, toggles and rings by itself.\\nBoth run off the compressor: with the diesel\\nshut down there are no signals.\\n[F] - headlight: on / off, as in a car.\\nIt burns off the end the reverser has picked.\\n[Shift+F] - cab dome light.\\nBy its light you can read in the cab at night.\\nThe number boards light the number itself and\\nburn whenever she has any charge at all.\\nHeadlight and dome drain the battery; the\\nboards do not. Left on, they will flatten her.\\nPAD: left bumper - horn. Right - bell.\\nThe headlight is on the cab menu.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Start": "STARTING\\nReverser to N or the starter will not turn.\\nTap [W] - one start attempt.\\nRuns itself: prime ~1.5s, then crank ~1.6s.\\nNo catch - tap [W] again, the prime is kept.\\nCaught - ~4s warm-up, limited power.\\nEvery attempt drains the battery.\\nWorse odds: cold, stale fuel. Rain does not.\\nNo fuel or a flat battery - no start.\\nSHUTTING DOWN\\nTap [S] at notch 0 and at a standstill.\\nPAD: D-pad up starts, D-pad down shuts down.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Supporters": "SUPPORTERS\\nPeople who donated to this mod.\\nThank you.\\nMudyan\\nSample\\nDrewGoodOne",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Track": "SWITCHES\\nRight-click the switch -> 'Railroad switch':\\nmain line (straight) or diverging track.\\nThe setting is saved.\\nHITS\\nFence, sign, cone, door, tree - smashed.\\nConcrete - near stop, can be pushed through.\\nCar on a crossing - crumpled and thrown off.\\nOn a server she destroys it instead, and\\nbelow about 4 m/s she stops at it.\\nFreight car, locomotive - hard stop.\\nEvery hit takes condition (COND).\\nCondition 0 - OUT OF ORDER, engine dies.",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_Note_Translation": "",
  "translate_en|mods/Railroader/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/IG_UI.json|IGUI_RR_OutOfOrder": "OUT OF ORDER - the locomotive is worn out (condition 0)",
